"Generate a simple 1D plot. Calls `matplotlib.pyplot.plot` with keyword "
"arguments 'kwargs'. For a list of 'kwargs' see the `matplotlib plot "
"documentation <https://matplotlib.org/stable/api/_as_gen/matplotlib.pyplot."
"plot.html>`_"
msgstr ""

